	"data": "<!-- scanner: tagged active/ongoing but not updated in 88d — review -->\n\nBevy Physics Mastery\n\n\"For Bevy I want to make a physics sort of simulator. I'd like to just work on a physics system from scratch.\" — cithoreal, May 2026\n\nVision\n\nLearn physics deeply by building a physics simulator from scratch in Bevy (Rust game engine). Not using an existing physics crate — actually implementing the math. The goal is understanding, not just a product.\n\nThis is a learning project first, a game engine…",
